      "content": "but even thinking about calling someone feels like just another thing on my to-do list that i don't have the energy for. everyone just tells me to \"hold on\" or \"it gets better,\" but they don't get it. they don't see how every single day is a battle just to exist. part of me feels like maybe i'm just being selfish for wanting it to be over. like, is it wrong to just want the peace of not having to fight anymore?",
